<!--
  City skyline, outline only, for the Home header background.

  Authored as a vector rather than sourced as a bitmap: it is ~2 KB instead of
  a PNG per density, stays sharp on any screen, and carries no third-party
  licence into the app.

  Strokes only, no fills. It sits behind the app title and the search bar, so
  anything solid would fight the text for contrast. The caller draws it at low
  alpha; these paths are white so it tints correctly against the header
  gradient.
-->
